[2026-03-14T19:26:25.433Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PRcctAp5FCZbp1RzMX8NKJ","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me create a comprehensive final report with all the information gathered:\n\n## AirbnbClone App Exploration Report\n\nI've completed a thorough exploration of the AirbnbClone app. Here's everything you need to know to write the Host Dashboard components:\n\n---\n\n## 1. APP SPECIFICATION (AppSpec.md)\n\nThe AirbnbClone is a vacation rental marketplace with:\n- **Core Pages**: Login/Register, Home/Search, Property Detail, My Trips, **Host Dashboard**, User Profile, Write Review\n- **Key Features**: Property listings, search/filtering, bookings, reviews, favorites, host management\n\n**Host Dashboard Spec (Section 5):**\n- **Stats Overview**: Total listings (active only), active bookings (pending + confirmed), total earnings (completed bookings sum), average rating\n- **Listings Tab**: Grid of host's properties with edit/deactivate actions, \"Add Listing\" button\n- **Bookings Tab**: Table of bookings for host's properties with status filters (All, Pending, Confirmed, Completed, Cancelled)\n- **Add Listing Form**: 7-step multi-step form (property type & title → location → details → amenities → photos → pricing → review & publish)\n\n---\n\n## 2. TEST SPECIFICATION (docs/tests.md)\n\nComprehensive test requirements covering:\n- **StatsOverview**: \n  - 4 stat cards (Total Listings, Active Bookings, Total Earnings, Average Rating)\n  - Must redirect to /login if unauthenticated\n  - Must show upgrade prompt if user is not a host\n  - Properly handle empty/zero states\n  \n- **ListingsTab**:\n  - Grid of host's active properties\n  - Each card shows: title, image, price/night, status badge (Active/Inactive), rating, review count\n  - Edit button → navigates to `/properties/:id`\n  - Deactivate button for active properties (with confirmation dialog)\n  - Activate button for inactive properties\n  - \"Add Listing\" button visible\n  - Tab switching and repeated use work correctly\n\n- **BookingsTab**:\n  - Table with columns: Property, Guest, Check-in, Check-out, Guests, Total, Status, Actions\n  - Status filters: All, Pending, Confirmed, Cancelled, Completed (All selected by default)\n  - Filtering works correctly\n  - Action buttons: \"Confirm\" for pending, \"Cancel\" for pending/confirmed (with dialogs)\n  - Completed/cancelled bookings have no action buttons\n  - Status badges with correct colors (yellow=pending, green=confirmed, red=cancelled, blue=completed)\n\n- **AddListingForm**:\n  - 7-step modal form with progress indicator\n  - Step 1: Property type dropdown + title input\n  - Step 2: Address (with autocomplete/geocoding), city, state, country\n  - Step 3: Max guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms (numeric with increment/decrement)\n  - Step 4: Amenities checkboxes grouped by category (Essentials, Features, Safety, Location)\n  - Step 5: Photo URLs with add/remove/preview, requires at least 1\n  - Step 6: Price per night ($) + cleaning fee ($)\n  - Step 7: Review all data with \"Publish\" button\n  - Back/Next/Cancel buttons with data persistence\n  - Cancel shows confirmation dialog\n  - Publish calls POST /api/properties + POST /api/property-images\n\n---\n\n## 3. DESIGN SYSTEM (src/index.css)\n\nUses **Tailwind CSS** with custom theme variables:\n- **Colors**:\n  - Primary: `#FF5A5F` (coral red, Airbnb brand)\n  - Primary Dark: `#E04E52`\n  - Primary Light: `#FF787C`\n  - Background: `#FFFFFF` (white)\n  - Background Secondary: `#F7F7F7` (light gray)\n  - Text: `#222222` (dark gray)\n  - Text Secondary: `#717171` (medium gray)\n  - Status: Pending `#F0AD4E` (yellow), Confirmed `#5CB85C` (green), Cancelled `#D9534F` (red), Completed `#5BC0DE` (blue)\n  - Border: `#DDDDDD`, Border Dark: `#B0B0B0`\n\n**Typography**: System fonts (-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, etc.)\n**Spacing**: Tailwind defaults with custom gaps\n**Components**: Rounded cards, subtle shadows, smooth transitions\n\n---\n\n## 4. REDUX STATE STRUCTURE\n\n**Store Setup** (`src/store.ts`):\n```\nstore.reducer:\n  - auth (authSlice)\n  - properties (propertiesSlice)\n  - favorites (favoritesSlice)\n  - amenities (amenitiesSlice)\n  - propertyDetail (propertyDetailSlice)\n  - bookings (bookingsSlice)\n```\n\n**Auth Slice** (`src/slices/authSlice.ts`):\n```typescript\nUser {\n  id, email, name, avatar_url, bio, phone, is_host, created_at\n}\nActions: loginUser(), registerUser()\nReducers: logout(), clearError()\n```\n\n**Bookings Slice** (`src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts`):\n```typescript\nBooking {\n  id, property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price,\n  status: 'pending'|'confirmed'|'cancelled'|'completed',\n  special_requests, created_at, property_title?, property_city?,\n  property_country?, property_image?, has_review?\n}\nActions: createBooking(), fetchUserBookings(), cancelBooking()\n```\n\n**Properties Slice** (`src/slices/propertiesSlice.ts`):\n```typescript\nProperty {\n  id, host_id, title, description, property_type,\n  price_per_night, cleaning_fee, max_guests, bedrooms, beds,\n  bathrooms, address, city, state, country, latitude, longitude,\n  check_in_time, check_out_time, is_active, created_at, updated_at,\n  // Detail fields:\n  host_name?, host_avatar?, host_bio?, host_since?,\n  host_listing_count?, images?, amenities?, reviews?, avg_rating?, review_count?\n}\nSearchFilters {\n  city, checkIn, checkOut, guests, propertyType,\n  minPrice, maxPrice, minBedrooms, minBeds, minBathrooms,\n  amenityIds, page\n}\nActions: fetchProperties(filters)\nReducers: setFilters(), resetFilters(), setPage()\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. BACKEND ENDPOINTS\n\n**Key Endpoints** (`netlify/functions/`):\n\n- `POST /api/auth` - Login/register (returns User)\n- `GET /api/properties` - List properties with filters (city, check_in, check_out, guests, property_type, price range, bedrooms/beds/bathrooms, amenities, page, limit)\n- `GET /api/properties/:id` - Get property detail (includes host info, images, amenities, reviews)\n- `POST /api/properties` - Create property (host only)\n- `PUT /api/properties/:id` - Update property (owner only)\n- `DELETE /api/properties/:id` - Deactivate property (sets is_active=false)\n- `POST /api/property-images` - Add image to property\n- `GET /api/bookings?guest_id=X` - Get user's bookings\n- `GET /api/host-bookings` - Get bookings for host's properties (likely similar structure)\n- `POST /api/bookings` - Create booking\n- `PUT /api/bookings/:id` - Update booking status\n- `GET /api/amenities` - List all amenities\n- `GET /api/reviews?property_id=X` - Get reviews\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPONENT PATTERNS & EXAMPLES\n\n**Existing Components to Reference**:\n\n**PropertyCard** (`src/components/PropertyCard.tsx`):\n- Props: `{ property: Property }`\n- Uses Lucide icons (`Star`)\n- Tailwind classes: rounded-xl, shadow, hover:scale-105, aspect-[4/3]\n- Status badges with absolute positioning\n- FavoriteButton component integrated\n- testid patterns for testing\n\n**TripCard** (`src/components/TripCard.tsx`):\n- Props: `{ booking: Booking; onCancel: () => void }`\n- Includes icons (Calendar, MapPin)\n- Status color mapping (statusColors object)\n- Status label mapping\n- Conditional action buttons (Cancel, Write Review, Reviewed badge)\n- Date formatting helper function\n- e.stopPropagation() for nested buttons\n\n**SearchBar** (`src/components/SearchBar.tsx`):\n- Form-based with React hooks (useState)\n- Props: `{ onSearch, initialCity?, initialCheckIn?, initialCheckOut?, initialGuests? }`\n- Date validation (min={today}, min={checkIn})\n- Rounded-full styling\n- Search icon button\n- testid attributes on inputs\n\n**PropertyGrid** (`src/components/PropertyGrid.tsx`):\n- Props: `{ properties: Property[]; loading: boolean }`\n- Loading spinner with Loader2 icon\n- Empty state handling\n- Grid layout: grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4\n- Maps properties to PropertyCard components\n\n**MyTrips Page** (`src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`):\n- Uses useNavigate, useSelector, useDispatch\n- Auth check with redirect to /login if not authenticated\n- Fetches bookings on mount\n- State management with dialog for cancel confirmation\n- Uses TripsTabs component\n\n**Home Page** (`src/pages/Home.tsx`):\n- Combines multiple components (SearchBar, CategoryFilter, PropertyGrid, FiltersPanel, Pagination)\n- useCallback for memoized handlers\n- Passes filters and callbacks to child components\n- Data-testid on main container\n\n---\n\n## 7. EXISTING REPOSITORY STRUCTURE\n\n```\n/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/\n├── src/\n│   ├── App.tsx (routes for: /login, /, /properties/:id, /trips)\n│   ├── store.ts (Redux store config)\n│   ├── index.css (Tailwind theme)\n│   ├── main.tsx\n│   ├── pages/\n│   │   ├── Login.tsx\n│   │   ├── Home.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyDetail.tsx\n│   │   ├── MyTrips.tsx\n│   │   └── (HostDashboard.tsx - NEEDS TO BE CREATED)\n│   ├── components/\n│   │   ├── AuthToggle.tsx\n│   │   ├── LoginForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── RegisterForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── SearchBar.tsx\n│   │   ├── CategoryFilter.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyGrid.tsx\n│   │   ├── FiltersPanel.tsx\n│   │   ├── Pagination.tsx\n│   │   ├── ImageGallery.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyHeader.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyInfo.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyDescription.tsx\n│   │   ├── AmenitiesList.tsx\n│   │   ├── HostInfoCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── ReviewsSection.tsx\n│   │   ├── BookingCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── FavoriteButton.tsx\n│   │   ├── TripCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── TripsTabs.tsx\n│   │   ├── CancelBookingDialog.tsx\n│   │   └── (StatsOverview.tsx, ListingsTab.tsx, BookingsTab.tsx, AddListingForm.tsx - NEED TO BE CREATED)\n│   └── slices/\n│       ├── authSlice.ts\n│       ├── propertiesSlice.ts\n│       ├── bookingsSlice.ts\n│       ├── favoritesSlice.ts\n│       ├── propertyDetailSlice.ts\n│       └── amenitiesSlice.ts\n├── netlify/functions/\n│   ├── db.ts (neon SQL setup)\n│   ├── auth.ts\n│   ├── properties.ts\n│   ├── bookings.ts\n│   ├── favorites.ts\n│   ├── amenities.ts\n├── docs/\n│   └── tests.md (comprehensive test specs)\n├── AppSpec.md (full specification)\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── package.json\n└── netlify.toml\n```\n\n---\n\n## 8. KEY REQUIREMENTS FOR YOUR IMPLEMENTATION\n\n**Components to Build**:\n\n1. **StatsOverview** - Display 4 stat cards with data from Redux\n2. **ListingsTab** - Grid of host's properties with edit/deactivate actions\n3. **BookingsTab** - Table of host's bookings with status filters and action buttons\n4. **AddListingForm** - 7-step modal form with full wizard\n5. **HostDashboard Page** - Main page tying all components together with tab switching\n\n**Key Technical Points**:\n- Use Redux for state management (auth, bookings, properties)\n- Fetch host-specific data using API endpoints\n- Implement auth checks (redirect to /login if not authenticated, show upgrade if not host)\n- Use Tailwind CSS for styling with theme variables\n- Implement proper error handling and loading states\n- Use Lucide icons consistently\n- Add testid attributes for testing\n- Handle dialogs/confirmations for destructive actions\n- Implement data persistence in multi-step form\n- Validate all form inputs with error messages\n\n**Route to Add**:\n- `/hosting` → HostDashboard page (requires auth check and host status check)\n\n---\n\n## FILES TO READ FOR IMPLEMENTATION CONTEXT\n\n**Absolute Paths** (for reference):\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/store.ts` - Redux store structure\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/authSlice.ts` - User type and auth actions\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts` - Booking type and actions\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/propertiesSlice.ts` - Property type and search actions\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx` - Page structure pattern\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx` - Complex page with multiple components\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src